# The user services whose unit files the `dotfiles` unit deploys, which is why
# it requires it — enabling them before deployment would find nothing.
#
# Linger is enabled here rather than in a unit of its own because this was its
# only consumer: without it the user's systemd instance stops at logout and
# the timers below never fire.
kind: action
capabilities: develop
requires: dotfiles
optional: systemctl,loginctl
